{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314820/extras/\u043e\u0442\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f-steam.png?t=1748796512\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314820/extras/Info.gif?t=1748796512\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dive into a dark world where imagination turns dangerous.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drawn Tale Demo</strong> is a teaser version of a narrative-driven 3D adventure with elements of horror, presented in a unique hand-drawn visual style.<br>You play as a boy named Mor, trapped inside the twisted maze of his own mind. This demo chapter acts as a prologue to the full story, setting the mood and tone of the journey ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll solve eerie puzzles, explore unsettling environments, and endure moments of psychological tension as the line between reality and illusion begins to blur. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314820/extras/\u043e\u0442\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f-steam.png?t=1748796512\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314820/extras/Features.gif?t=1748796512\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A heavy dose of creepypasta-inspired horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A stylized hand-drawn visual look in full 3D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique and unsettling story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark, dramatic, and immersive atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original puzzles woven into the narrative  <br>  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3314820?t=1748796512","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai